  "name": "Ley Lines (Su)",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, the geomancer learns to create magical connections with a specific type of terrain (aquatic, desert, forest, hills, marsh, mountains, or plains). In that terrain, the geomancer's effective caster level for all spells increases by +1. At 6th level and every 4 levels thereafter (10th, 14th, 18th), the character may either choose a new terrain in which to receive the benefit (at +1), or increase her effective caster level in a previously chosen terrain by an additional +1.</p>",
